      hu: ["Ã–sszesen 93 jelentÅ‘sebb vÃ­zesÃ©ssel rendelkezik", "Karlovac kÃ¶zelÃ©ben torkollik a Korana folyÃ³ba", "NÃ©pszerÅ± kajak- Ã©s rafting Ãºtvonal", "NyÃ¡ron a vÃ­z hÅ‘mÃ©rsÃ©klete elÃ©ri a 24 fokot"],
      ro: ["Are 93 de cascade distinctive", "Se varsÄƒ Ã®n rÃ¢ul Korana lÃ¢ngÄƒ Karlovac", "DestinaÈ›ie popularÄƒ pentru caiac È™i rafting", "Temperatura apei atinge 24 de grade vara"],
      en: ["Features 93 distinct waterfalls", "Joins the Korana river near Karlovac", "Popular destination for kayaking and rafting", "Water temperature reaches 24 degrees in summer"],
